WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
Welcome, I'm Melissa Dawn Simkins and I am

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:14.080
honored to be your coach through this flagship

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.560
experience called the M.V.P. Accelerator Manager Track.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.640
Now you're embarking on a dual journey.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.614
While your direct report is digging deep into their own potential,

00:00:26.614 --> 00:00:28.240
you will be right alongside

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:38.240
them, not just as a supervisor, but as a high-performance Player-Coach.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.877
You've officially entered the M.V.P.

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:44.760
Accelerator Manager Track in the Athleadership Arena.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.886
Now, Athleadership is where elite athletic

00:00:47.886 --> 00:00:51.160
mindset meets next-level leadership, mastery

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:57.900
to fuel resilience, unlock purpose, and drive lasting performance.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:00.675
The Athleadership Performance System is our

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:03.580
comprehensive measurement analytics framework

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:08.354
that tracks leadership transformation across the A.R.A.W.

00:01:08.354 --> 00:01:11.620
dimensions we call Agility, Resilience,

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:14.940
Alignment, and Wellbeing.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.580
We also call this the Core 4.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:22.340
Now, it's backed by neuroscience and performance psychology.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:26.920
It is the science and the soul of our model.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:31.720
To ensure we're all aligned, let's clarify our key terms.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:37.920
You'll hear me refer to your direct report as the player or the Athleader.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.180
An Athleader is anyone committed to conditioning

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:44.440
their leadership with the discipline and mindset

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:51.500
of an elite athlete to fuel resilience, unlock purpose, and sustain performance.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.255
And if you've never seen yourself as an athlete,

00:01:54.255 --> 00:01:56.780
or if your direct report hasn't either, it's

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.140
OK.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.440
This isn't about playing sports or lifting weights.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:04.929
It's about unlocking the discipline, the mindset,

00:02:04.929 --> 00:02:07.920
and the clarity and inner strength already

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.000
in you to win from within.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.653
You are the Player-Coach,

00:02:12.653 --> 00:02:16.820
participating in your own leadership development while actively

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.800
coaching your player.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.818
Our goal is to give you practical frameworks to

00:02:21.818 --> 00:02:24.900
make your coaching conversations more impactful,

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:30.160
your team more aligned, and your own leadership more sustainable.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.387
Before we begin, I want to ask you to reflect on

00:02:33.387 --> 00:02:36.480
one leadership behavior you want to strengthen

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.240
for yourself.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:41.933
What is one leadership behavior you want to improve

00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:45.120
for how you support your team's performance?

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.440
Keep this front and center as we go through

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:51.760
this journey and build your own 90-day plan

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.160
over the course of this experience.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:58.540
We'll come back at the end and celebrate your progress.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.737
In our next video,

00:02:59.737 --> 00:03:04.660
we'll begin your conditioning by focusing on the most important person you

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.580
lead, yourself.
